{"5031120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dribble Basket", "steam_appid": 5031120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5120470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribble your ball to victory through challenging levels where every bounce matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shots, no aiming, and no shortcuts. The only way forward is to control the ball through physics-based movement and carefully timed bounces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is driven by physics. The ball reacts naturally to every surface, obstacle, and movement. Nothing is bolted to the ground: every bounce, roll, and collision can change your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling the ball may feel difficult at first, but mastering its movement is incredibly rewarding. Learn how to use momentum, timing, and precision to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple controls, challenging mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand, difficult to master. The challenge comes from learning how the ball moves and adapting to each situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based basketball gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shooting mechanics: only bouncing and controlling the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging obstacle courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with deep mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying movement and realistic interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the bounce?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribble your ball to victory through challenging levels where every bounce matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shots, no aiming, and no shortcuts. The only way forward is to control the ball through physics-based movement and carefully timed bounces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is driven by physics. The ball reacts naturally to every surface, obstacle, and movement. Nothing is bolted to the ground: every bounce, roll, and collision can change your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling the ball may feel difficult at first, but mastering its movement is incredibly rewarding. Learn how to use momentum, timing, and precision to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple controls, challenging mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand, difficult to master. The challenge comes from learning how the ball moves and adapting to each situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based basketball gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shooting mechanics: only bouncing and controlling the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging obstacle courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with deep mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying movement and realistic interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the bounce?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Bounce your way to the basket in this physics-based basketball challenge. Master your dribble, overcome obstacles, and guide the ball to victory with nothing but timing and control."